#   substitute linux-aurora here: it has no t8152 DT, no nub-gpio fix.
# - omarchy-mlx wheel pin (SLOT G609 in pkgbuilds/omarchy-mlx).
# - ane_h18 in omarchy-ane-dkms needs an omarchy-ane tag carrying ane/h18
#   (SLOT G615-ane-h18-tag).
